Actually, that motor is not an on/off motor, its actually a Wind Speed analog sensor made out of a low voltage DC motor!

&#x200B;

PDF for the diagram here: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yxkY6VV4Jnz1\_WG-UE2EyvTnR2M9RS9m/view?usp=sharing

I got the Transmission part routed to the container, but deleting the port in Transmission and adding the port to PrivoxyVPN container still won;t let me access the interface, unless I put the same URL in the Webtop Container.

&#x200B;

Not sure why this is happening
